<title>BELGIUM: Belgian unemployment falls to 12.9 pct in April.</title>
<headline>Belgian unemployment falls to 12.9 pct in April.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Employment Ministry released the following unemployment data -</p>
<p>    BELGIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	   April	March	April 96</p>
<p>    Total registered jobless (*) 551,397    560,460    573,717</p>
<p>    Pct of workforce		 12.9	 13.1	 13.4</p>
<p>NOTE - (*) all registered unemployed, whether or not they receive unemployment benefits.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
